{"id":"bd15b0d34ad7970a","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-amalgamation.md","title":"Amalgamation","display":"df-amalgamation — Amalgamation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-amalgamation","aliases":["93-df-amalgamation"],"display":"df-amalgamation — Amalgamation","depends_on":["[[93-df-relation-composition]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-embedding]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-amalgamation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-amalgamation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-amalgamation — Amalgamation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e8852a067d7d040c\" href=\"?note=e8852a067d7d040c\" title=\"93-df-relation-composition\">93-df-relation-composition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d611f4ac8b8895ab\" href=\"?note=d611f4ac8b8895ab\" title=\"93-df-embedding\">93-df-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\)</span> is a class of algebras of one fixed similarity type.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}\\)</span> is the one-place similarity-type predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\\)</span> is the three-place embedding predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d611f4ac8b8895ab\" href=\"?note=d611f4ac8b8895ab\" title=\"93-df-embedding\">93-df-embedding</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Amalgamation}(-;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Amalgamation}(-;\\tau)\\)</span> is the amalgamation-property predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}amalgamation}\\vdash \\mathrm{Amalgamation}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\land\\forall\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall f\\;\\forall g\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(f,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(g,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf C)\\to\\exists\\mathbf D\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists f&#39;\\;\\exists g&#39;\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(f&#39;,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf D)\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(g&#39;,\\mathbf C,\\mathbf D)\\land f&#39;\\circ f=g&#39;\\circ g\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}amalgamation}\\vdash \\mathrm{Amalgamation}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\land\\forall\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall f\\;\\forall g\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(f,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(g,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf C)\\to\\exists\\mathbf D\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists f&#39;\\;\\exists g&#39;\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(f&#39;,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf D)\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(g&#39;,\\mathbf C,\\mathbf D)\\land f&#39;\\circ f=g&#39;\\circ g\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The signature parameter is exposed because amalgamation is a property of a same-type class. Amalgamation requires a commuting square, not a categorical pushout.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-relation-composition","status":"resolved","id":"e8852a067d7d040c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-relation-composition]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"d611f4ac8b8895ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}$ is the one-place similarity-type predicate of [[93-df-similarity-type]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"d611f4ac8b8895ab","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}$ is the three-place embedding predicate of [[93-df-embedding]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Amalgamation}(-;\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}amalgamation}\\vdash \\mathrm{Amalgamation}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\land\\forall\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall f\\;\\forall g\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(f,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(g,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf C)\\to\\exists\\mathbf D\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists f'\\;\\exists g'\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(f',\\mathbf B,\\mathbf D)\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(g',\\mathbf C,\\mathbf D)\\land f'\\circ f=g'\\circ g\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1488,"backlinks":[{"id":"6ec45a9f1f2cb632","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f4fabcfa63f1f102","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Amalgamation}$ and $\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}$ are the predicates from [[93-df-amalgamation]] and [[93-df-embedding]]."},{"id":"47b7e4c7fc398110","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Amalgamation}$ and $\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-amalgamation]] and [[93-df-embedding]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-amalgamation]]"}],"outgoing":["e8852a067d7d040c","6730349967b8ffce","d611f4ac8b8895ab","ee84ed8b0fae5bc3"]}